    (property "Note" "10k, NOT the 470 ohm supervisor.cir sized for the six driver gates. That figure came from Miller coupling at Crss = 500 pF on a node swinging to a 100 V boost rail. A relay drain is clamped by its own flyback diode or TVS, under 60 V. Recheck if a relay FET with large Crss is chosen." (id 5) (at 301.84 281.92 0)
